# Per-Source Flat Layout

Every external data source gets ONE flat directory: `external/{source}/`
- schemas.py (raw API models)
- normalize.py (raw → canonical)
- __init__.py (re-exports)
- mocks/ (VCR cassettes)

NEVER nest sources: no `external/sports/sources/`, no `external/cloud_sdks/aws/`
NEVER create domain-grouped directories: each source is independent
